==English==
[[File:Nadeldrucker NEC Pinwriter P2 Plus.jpg|thumb|250px|upright|A dot matrix printer]]

===Etymology===
{{ety|en|:inh|enm:*printen<ety:apheretic<enm:emprinten<ety:der<la:imprimo>>>>|id=write}}
From {{inh|en|enm|*printen}}, {{m|enm|prenten}}, {{m|enm|preenten}}, an [[apheretic]] form of {{m|enm|emprinten}}, {{m|enm|enprinten||to impress; imprint}} (see {{l|en|imprint}}). Compare {{cog|nl|prent||a print, a printed picture}}, {{cog|gml|prenten||to print; write}}, {{cog|da|prente||to print}}, {{cog|sv|prenta||to write German letters}}. Compare also Late {{cog|fro|printer}}, {{m|fro|preindre||to press}}, from {{cog|la|premere||to press}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|prĭnt}}, {{IPA|en|/pɹɪnt/}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-print.ogg|a=US}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɪnt|s=1}}

