===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|uncountable}} [[book|Books]] and other material created by [[printing press]]es, considered collectively or as a [[medium]].
#: {{ux|en|Three citations are required for each meaning, including one in '''print'''.}}
#: {{ux|en|TV and the Internet haven't killed '''print'''.}}
# {{lb|en|uncountable}} Clear [[handwriting]], especially, writing without connected letters as in [[cursive]].
#: {{ux|en|Write in '''print''' using block letters.}}
# {{lb|en|uncountable}} The [[letter]]s forming the [[text]] of a document.
#: {{ux|en|The '''print''' is too small for me to read.}}
# {{lb|en|countable}} A [[newspaper]].
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1978|author=w:Philip Larkin|title=The Winter Palace|passage=I spent my second quarter-century<br/>Losing what I had learnt at university<br/>And refusing to take in what had happened since.<br/>Now I know none of the names in the public '''prints''' {{...}}}}
# A visible impression on a surface.
#: {{ux|en|Using a crayon, the girl made a '''print''' of the leaf under the page.}}
# A [[fingerprint]].
#: {{ux|en|Did the police find any '''prints''' at the scene?}}
# A [[footprint]].
# {{senseid|en|picture}}{{lb|en|visual art}} A [[picture]] that was created in [[multiple]] [[copy|copies]] by printing.
#* {{quote-journal|en|date=1957 August|title=Notes and News: Tithebarn Street Station, Liverpool|journal=Railway Magazine|page=589|text=An old '''print''' was discovered some time ago in an arch at Waterloo Dock Goods Station[,] Liverpool, in use as a backing on which to write time sheets.}}
# {{senseid|en|photography}} {{lb|en|photography}} A [[photograph]] that has been printed onto paper from the [[negative]].
# {{lb|en|film}} A copy of a [[film]] that can be [[project]]ed.
# [[cloth|Cloth]] that has had a [[pattern]] of [[dye]] printed onto it.
#* {{RQ:Landon Lady Anne Granard|pages=20–21|volume=I|passage=The poor are very unreasonable; a kind look and word often go farther in winning upon their affection than even a piece of coarse flannel, or a remnant of dark '''print'''.}}
# {{lb|en|architecture}} A [[plaster cast]] in [[bas relief]].
# {{lb|en|finance}} A [[datum]].
